OL,3,AEx-chief constable investigated over
OL,4,AIsraeli fan ban
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe former chief constable of West
OL,7,FMidlands Police is being investigated
OL,8,Fby the police watchdog for gross
OL,9,Fmisconduct over the banning of Israeli
OL,10,FMaccabi Tel Aviv fans from a match
OL,11,Fagainst Aston Villa.
OL,13,FThe Independent Office for Police
OL,14,FConduct (IOPC) has given notice that it
OL,15,Fis investigating Craig Guildford, as
OL,16,Fwell as three police officers and a
OL,17,Fstaff member.
OL,23,APub: 26-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,307,300,200,140,0,100
