OL,3,AEx-chief constable investigated over
OL,4,AIsraeli fan ban
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn independent investigation was
OL,7,Flaunched by the IOPC in January to
OL,8,Fexamine the involvement of West
OL,9,FMidlands Police officers in the
OL,10,Fplanning and preparation of the match
OL,11,Fat Villa Park on 6 November 2025.
OL,13,FThe ban attracted national and
OL,14,Finternational debate, with the
OL,15,Fgovernment saying it would do
OL,16,Feverything in its power to overturn it.
OL,23,APub: 26-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
